			"notes": "# CHANGELOG\n\n- Added common config toggles for Blaze Burner integration and dynamic metal seeds.\n- Kinetic Catalytic Plug/Wildfire Stirling now accept and consume gaseous fuel.\n- Mini boilers now correctly explode when reaching full gas capacity when `enabled`.\n- Fixed fractional Clockwork Attenuator speeds for Inferno Forge, pumps, and injector-fed crystal seeds.\n- Corrected Exchange Table placement facing.\n- Removed the Clockwork Pickaxe’s client-only particle dependency from common server code.\n- Fixed Sable’s tag-reload path with valid glass pane tags; removed obsolete aluminium aliases and regenerated the aluminum coefficient recipe."
		},
