			"notes": "# CHANGELOG\n\n## Fixes\n- Removed the Kinetic Boiler until i figure out a better implimentation for it.\n- Item transfers now enforce filters during network routing and prioritize routes containing transfers.\n- Melter top no longer proxies ember capability.\n- Empty item stacks use the safe 1.21.1 optional serialization API, preventing the item-dial reload crash.\n- Centrifugal Mixer now respects catalytic and clockwork speed modifiers while maintaining correct total ember consumption.\n- Item, fluid, and ember dials now provide live comparator output.\n- Hearth Coil cooking time now correctly scales with heat and upgrades.\n- Fixed issues in the Geolithic Separator.\n- Fixed a bug where the Kinetic Actuator does not work when the Create power is rotation in the wrong direction.\n- Create Display links can now be used on Item/Fluid pipes to read metrics and information like fluid transfer per second."
		},
